  'We studied our competitors, even going as far as buying competing products to see what works and doesn\'t for the North American market. We came up with two distinct systems for two different use cases: 3-Season and 4-Season.': { EN: 'We studied our competitors, even going as far as buying competing products to see what works and doesn\'t for the North American market. We came up with two distinct systems for two different use cases: 3-Season and 4-Season.', FR: 'Nous avons étudié nos concurrents, allant même jusqu\'à acheter des produits concurrents. Nous avons conçu deux systèmes distincts pour deux cas d\'utilisation différents : 3 saisons et 4 saisons.' },
