  'Well over a thousand hours of engineering went into our design and development. Add another small fortune for testing and validation by two engineers who signed off on the design.': { EN: 'Well over a thousand hours of engineering went into our design and development. Add another small fortune for testing and validation by two engineers who signed off on the design.', FR: 'Plus de mille heures d\'ingénierie ont été consacrées à notre conception. Ajoutez une petite fortune pour les tests et la validation par deux ingénieurs qui ont approuvé la conception.' },
